ALBUKHR Pi dApp Launch Service — Phase 0 Audit
Date: 10 October 2026
Scope: Read-only inspection of app repository, admin repository search, and Mainnet/Testnet Supabase objects.
Change status: No code, SQL, Storage, permission, or production changes made.
1. Executive finding
The repository contains the public entry point and UI for Pi dApp Launch Service, but the complete submission and request-history workflow is not present in the current main branch. Several scripts referenced by those pages return GitHub 404 NOT_FOUND. Supabase Mainnet and Testnet have no matching service-specific table or RPC names. Admin repository search found no dedicated dApp request workflow.
Decision: Do not treat the service as implementation-ready based only on this branch. First verify the deployed production assets, then implement through an isolated branch and staged Testnet QA before Mainnet release.
Important limitation: The live host could not be reached from the inspection environment, so the findings confirm the GitHub main branch and connected Supabase projects—not the exact assets currently served to users in production. Production may differ from the repository.
