6. Next steps (no implementation yet)
Verify the live production assets in Pi Browser or through the actual hosting/deployment console: confirm loaded HTML, script responses, and runtime errors for submit and request history.
Decide the authoritative payment method(s) and amount policy before designing the payment record or confirmation workflow.
Produce a server-first data contract: request lifecycle, user identity source, price/quote, payment evidence, Admin decisions, audit events, attachments, and notifications.
Implement in a separate branch; use isolated Testnet data and storage for QA. Do not deploy to Mainnet until the critical test cases pass and changes are explicitly approved.
